# Easy AIO Installer Requirements

Before installing the pack, make sure you meet these requirements:

- **ReShade 6.8.0 or higher** with full add-on support.
- **NVIDIA RTX GPU** 20, 30, 40, or 50 series (RTX 30 or newer recommended).
- **Latest NVIDIA drivers** installed.
- **Game with a working depth buffer** (required for Neural Rendering).
- **Single-player game** (anti-cheat may block injection).
- **Compatible with DirectX 10/11/12** (DX9 requires dgVoodoo2).
- **Game folder without restricted write permissions**.

If you have any issues, check the [main troubleshooting guide](./index.md).

